<title>USA: Excal Enterprises to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Excal Enterprises to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excal Enterprises Inc said on Tuesday that it has decided to repurchase up to $3,000,000 of its common stock through open market purchases.</p>
<p>Excal said initial purchases shall take place through one or more brokers commencing as soon as the next seven to 10 days.</p>
</text>
